DTSTART:20260211T023000Z
DTEND:20260211T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20260211T023000Z
UID:ie8barMuxg
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nThe Pacific Northwestern In his 
 final western (set in a Montana gold rush town but filmed entirely in the 
 wilderness near Yakima)\, Gary Cooper stars as Joseph Frail\, a doctor who
  finds his life complicated while nursing a Swiss immigrant back to health
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-pacific-northwestern/the
 -hanging-tree\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
