DTSTART:20260218T023000Z
DTEND:20260218T045000Z
DTSTAMP:20260218T023000Z
UID:l7xCQW1XtZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 122 mins (2h02m)\n\nThe Pacific Northwestern In 1820
 \, a cook and a Chinese immigrant team up to steal milk from a prized cow\
 , the first and only in the Oregon Country.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progra
 ms-and-events/the-pacific-northwestern/first-cow\n\nEstimated start: 18:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
